to my office,

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:05.371
and we got super hammered an
watched YouTube videos together.

00:05:05.371 --> 00:05:08.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it was pretty fun.
You ordered us cheeseburgers

00:05:08.207 --> 00:05:12.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we ate cheeseburgers o
your desk like it was a table.

00:05:12.779 --> 00:05:13.212 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yep.

00:05:13.212 --> 00:05:16.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Great. One of the greates
nights out of my life.

00:05:16.616 --> 00:05:17.050 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:19.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's the new Rainbow Room.
-Oh, yeah.

00:05:19.719 --> 00:05:23.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The new Rainbow Room
is office burgers and YouTube.

00:05:23.356 --> 00:05:24.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then we both --
At the end of the night,

00:05:24.757 --> 00:05:29.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
we both spun around
and we went, "New York City!

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:34.767
-I mean, that was probably
my wildest night out in New York

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:36.602 size:84% position:42% line:92%
in the last six months.

00:05:36.602 --> 00:05:37.103 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-100%.

00:05:37.103 --> 00:05:38.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I didn't leave
the building.

00:05:38.771 --> 00:05:40.006 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
You did --

00:05:40.006 --> 00:05:41.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
Since the last time you were
on the show -- obviously,

00:05:41.974 --> 00:05:45.712
as established, I've seen you --
you did get married.

00:05:45.712 --> 00:05:47.180 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Jost married."
And this is --

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:51.584 align:start size:94% position:6%
For people who couldn't tell
by Colin's gold chain,

00:05:51.584 --> 00:05:53.386 line:92%
he is from Staten Island.

00:05:53.386 --> 00:05:55.488 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Both laugh ]

00:05:55.488 --> 00:06:00.927
-That's where we did the wedding
and the reception.

00:06:00.927 --> 00:06:01.627 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Cans are real.

00:06:01.627 --> 00:06:04.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
My brother did
some great Photoshop work.

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:07.300 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know it looks real,
but they didn't actually tie

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.969 line:92%
a bunch of 100-foot-long can

00:06:09.969 --> 00:06:11.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
on the back of
the Staten Island Ferry.

00:06:11.671 --> 00:06:14.841
I mean, they probably -- Someone
would have used it as an excus

00:06:14.841 --> 00:06:18.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
to get bodies in the can
that they needed to get rid of

00:06:18.811 --> 00:06:22.081
Someone I grew up with would
have put bodies in the can

00:06:22.081 --> 00:06:24.016 size:75% position:38% line:92%
