00:06:32.625 --> 00:06:34.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's, like, the traditiona
idea of marriage.

00:06:34.927 --> 00:06:37.330 align:start size:94% position:6%
So instead, it's like,
just, again,

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.898 align:start size:94% position:6%
