"Tom &amp; Jerry,"

00:06:55.448 --> 00:06:57.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Scarlett went to film
"Black Widow."

00:06:57.683 --> 00:07:01.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
We'll see which one ends u
being the bigger hit.

00:07:01.187 --> 00:07:04.490 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Both laugh ]

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:05.425 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
