00:07:05.425 --> 00:07:08.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Colin, Colin,
do not put money on this.

00:07:08.528 --> 00:07:10.263 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-[ Laughs ]

00:07:10.263 --> 00:07:13.566
-We left -- We got engaged
then basically fled town,

00:07:13.566 --> 00:07:15.034 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I didn't see anyone
that summer.

00:07:15.034 --> 00:07:18.104
Then I went right back int
"SNL," and then COVID hit.

00:07:18.104 --> 00:07:20.540 align:start size:94% position:6%
So there's been basically
these two years

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.475 align:start size:94% position:6%
that have been a huge moment
in our lives

00:07:22.475 --> 00:07:24.710 size:78% position:39%
where we haven't seen
most of our friends.

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:26.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wait, am I finding out no
for the first time

00:07:26.846 --> 00:07:28.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
