00:07:31.517 --> 00:07:35.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
That's the big scoop.

00:07:35.188 --> 00:07:37.089 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:07:37.089 --> 00:07:40.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
We just had Regé on,
and hopefully we'll see,

00:07:40.293 --> 00:07:45.698 align:start size:94% position:6%
fingers crossed, Tom and Jerry
join Nick Jonas this week.

